       AAlltt++00 ((aanndd CCoommmmaanndd++00 oonn mmaaccOOSS))
              Resize video window to half its original size.

       AAlltt++11 ((aanndd CCoommmmaanndd++11 oonn mmaaccOOSS))
              Resize video window to its original size.

       AAlltt++22 ((aanndd CCoommmmaanndd++22 oonn mmaaccOOSS))
