       CCoommmmaanndd ++ ff ((mmaaccOOSS oonnllyy))
              Toggle fullscreen (see also ----ffss).

       (The following keybindings open a menu in the console that lets you
       choose from a list of items by typing part of the desired item, by
       clicking the desired item, or by navigating them with keybindings: DDoowwnn
       and CCttrrll++nn go down, UUpp and CCttrrll++pp go up, PPaaggee ddoowwnn and CCttrrll++ff scroll
       down one page, and PPaaggee uupp and CCttrrll++bb scroll up one page.)

       In track menus, selecting the current tracks disables it.

       gg--pp    Select a playlist entry.

       gg--ss    Select a subtitle track.

       gg--SS    Select a secondary subtitle track.

       gg--aa    Select an audio track.

       gg--vv    Select a video track.

       gg--tt    Select a track of any type.

       gg--cc    Select a chapter.

       gg--ee    Select an MKV edition or DVD/Blu-ray title.

       gg--ll    Select a subtitle line to seek to. This currently requires
              ffffmmppeegg in PPAATTHH, or in the same folder as mpv on Windows.

       gg--dd    Select an audio device.

       gg--hh    Select a file from the watch history. Requires
              ----ssaavvee--wwaattcchh--hhiissttoorryy.

       gg--ww    Select a file from watch later config files (see RESUMING
              PLAYBACK) to resume playing. Requires
              ----wwrriittee--ffiilleennaammee--iinn--wwaattcchh--llaatteerr--ccoonnffiigg.

       gg--bb    Select a defined input binding.

       gg--rr    Show the values of all properties.

       gg--mm,, MMEENNUU,, CCttrrll++pp
              Show a menu with miscellaneous entries.

       See SELECT for more information.

       (The following keys are valid if you have a keyboard with multimedia
       keys.)

       PPAAUUSSEE  Pause.

       SSTTOOPP   Stop playing and quit.

       PPRREEVVIIOOUUSS aanndd NNEEXXTT
              Seek backward/forward 1 minute.

       ZZOOOOMMIINN aanndd ZZOOOOMMOOUUTT
              Change video zoom.

       If you miss some older key bindings, look at
